Data (release assets *.ywrp.gz)
-------------------------------
Contains information from OpenStreetMap, © OpenStreetMap contributors, made available under the
Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
Each routing pack is a Derivative Database of OpenStreetMap and is itself offered under the ODbL 1.0.
Source extract: Geofabrik GmbH, https://download.geofabrik.de/ (OpenStreetMap data).

